Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就只差一点点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看  我拿了几杯酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys, look. Got me some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么  免费酒吧啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Open bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后  今晚的最大项目\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Finally, our biggest item of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,22英尺长的豪华游艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The 22-foot Gentleman's Daysailer sailboat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最高竞价是两万元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The winning bid was a whopping $20,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我猜的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was my guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜的就是两万啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guessed $20,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  这是拍卖会  不是靠猜  是靠买\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, it is an auction. You don't guess. You buy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有两万\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have $20,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你购得新船  乔伊崔比亚尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations on your new boat, Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下啦  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别理她  尽情享受吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forget her. You enjoy this. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个国家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"One nation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在神之下  不可分割  全民拥有自由公正\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...under God, indivisible, with liberty and justice for all."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得是这样背  香槟来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. I remembered it. The champagne is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  没事  没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay? Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm good. Are you good? Are you good? Is everything—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}are you—are you perrr-perfect?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好  我感觉不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有点冷   外套可以借我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a little cold. Can I have yourjacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行   我的外套不能借你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no, you can't have my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为给你  我就会冷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because then I would be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是觉得会冷  应该自己带外套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you thought you'd be cold, you should have brought a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过   除此之外  其它还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, other than that, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的没事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:09:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我这段时间一直都很好  我觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, I've been fine for a long time now and I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是托你的福\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the reason is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你嘴巴真甜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我遇到你之前  我的生活很乏味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Before I met you, I had really little life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能想象我的余生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I couldn't imagine growing old--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  不过让我说完  我的天哪  理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. But let me say it. Oh, my God. Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我是钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I'm Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  是理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  也许他看不见我们  理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh God, Maybe he won't see us. Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  钱德   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica. Chandler. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我为什么要抱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know why I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真好  彼此彼此  你把头发留长了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's good to see you. You too. You let your hair grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊对  没什么  你一直希望我留长的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Oh, that's right, you always wanted me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又开始留胡子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see your mustache is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的鼻子感到寂寞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, my nose got lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就没留胡子  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you don't have a mustache, which is good. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是钱德  我一感到不自在就想开玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Chandler. I make jokes when I'm uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  丽莎  摩妮卡  钱德  我们交往过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Lisa, Monica, Chandler. We used to date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查  我们的事应该保密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard! No one's supposed to know about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.27,0:10:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  我又来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, I did it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  我们坐下吧  好  我坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, wh-why don't we sit down? Yeah, I'll sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您的桌子准备好了  先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your table is ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴遇见你们  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Good to see you guys. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不介意  这一桌也是空的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you prefer, this table's available.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起坐应该不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That might be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这是个拍卖会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't know it was an auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为是猜一猜价格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I figured I'd take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以帮助慈善团体  免费得游艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Help a charity. Free boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么慈善组织会提供免费游艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would a charity give away a free boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪知道   做慈善吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Charity? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就买下这该死的船吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, just buy the damn boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你喝够了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, don't you think you've had enough to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在救助儿童\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just helping the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喝酒怎么能救助儿童\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How is you drinking helping the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喝得越多  孩子们喝的就越少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because the more I drink, the less there is for the kids to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,崔比亚尼先生   你的慷慨解囊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Tribbiani. Your contribution brings us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让兴建青少年活动中心的事大有进展\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a big step closer to building the youth center.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是很好奇  那艘船值多少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just out of curiosity, how much is that boat worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多是1万9\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it was valued at 19,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜得蛮准的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I was pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个坏消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, so, bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能买那艘船  我没有那么多钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I can't buy the boat. I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你真幽默\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! Joey, good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真会演  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good! Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我要走人了  你不能走  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So uh listen, I think I'm gonna take off now. Hey! You can't leave, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你答应了要买船的  这是个协议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You agreed to buy that boat. all right! It is a contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你走了  我的主管会宰了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, if you leave, my boss is gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么办  瑞秋  我没那么多钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what am I gonna do, Rach? I don't have that kind of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.59,0:12:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. Okay, okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这样吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找出价第二高的人  然后让他们去买\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll go to the next highest bidder, and we'll let them buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要出差价就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then you're just gonna pay the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.47,0:12:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白这些小孩要活动中心干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I don't know why the kids need a youth center anyway.Y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放了学跟我一样看电视  像我现在也蛮好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They should just watch TV after school like I did. And I turned out fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是不优秀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我们就躲在洗手间里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And so, we're hiding in the bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我溜了出来  但摩妮卡还没出来  她父母就进去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And-and then I sneak out. But before Monica can, her parents come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.03,0:12:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是我躲到浴帘后面  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I hide in the shower, next thing you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就在浴室地板上做起来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they're going at it right on the bathroom floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.91,0:12:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个  我有一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got a good one. I got a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一次撞见我父母  跟同一个男人做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I once walked in on both my parents making love to the same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴再见到你们   我想敬酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so great seeing you guys again. I'd like to make a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正如一位诗人所说  "在友谊的甜蜜里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, as a poet once said, "In the sweetness of friendship...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们尽情欢笑   分享欢乐吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...let there be laughter and sharing of pleasures for...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人心正是从每一件小事中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in the dew of little things...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,获得朝气  使我们的心灵充满活力"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the heart finds its morning and is refreshed."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  你们两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你开口之前  我们有事要说  猜猜我们吃饭时遇见谁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Before you say anything, have we got a story for you. Guess who we bumped into at dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁  理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who? Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你要和伊丽莎白约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you were going out with Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来是的   不过当时她忙着打水仗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I was but uh, she was a little busy with a water balloon fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  罗斯  有时大人也不会兑现他们的承诺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh Ross, sometimes grownups have commitments they just can't get out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许她对我是年轻了点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe she is too young for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我看到她跟朋友这么打闹   我觉得我就像个保姆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I was over there and she was running around with her friends, I felt like I was a babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于开始明白你们说的话了   我不知道该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I finally see what you were talking about. I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以衡量一下这段感情的利弊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you just weigh the good stuff about the relationship against the bad stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我该先做什么  衡量一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what I did when I first started weighing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   坏的方面   我比她大12岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, urn, bad stuff. Well, I'm- I'm 12 years older than she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学校发现   会开除你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If the school finds out you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.13,0:14:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要离开3个月  去参加夏令营\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's leaving for three months. For camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后   好的方面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, good stuff. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很可爱  很漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, she's sweet and pretty and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  唯一的问题是问你自己  你看得见未来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look Ross, the only question you need to ask is, do you see a future?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能想像跟她结婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you see yourself marrying her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  你做了  你已经娶她了  对不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God. You did it already. You married her, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有啦  我并没有  只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No! I didn't do that. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  老实说  我觉得我们没什么未来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Honestly, no, I don't, I don't see a big future with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的答案了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I think that's your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉她   我最恨这一步了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta talk to her. I hate this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忘了伊丽莎白  你要是不小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forget Elizabeth. I mean if you're not careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今年可能会结不到婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you may not get married at all this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rash , Rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出第二高价的人在一号桌  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Next highest bidder is at table one. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竞标到巴黎之旅的人坐4号桌  噢  好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh and uh the guy who got the Paris trip is at table four. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛管谁赢到巴黎之旅啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you care about the guy who won the Paris trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是双人之旅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a trip for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  竞标到巴黎之旅的人  在这一桌吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me. ls the person who won the Paris trip at this table?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was me. Oh. en chante.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  有没有一位波芒先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, excuse me is there a Mr. Bowmont at this table?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's me. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  你今天走运了  波芒先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh well, Hello. This is your lucky day, Mr. Bowmont.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘帆船又要卖了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The, uh, Gentleman Daysailer has become available again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开了1万8的价格  不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I believe you made a bid of $18,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须要付钱   这不是个竞猜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have to pay that. It's not just a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没竞标到船   实际上我还松了一口气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was actually relieved, uh, I didn't win the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆会宰了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My wife would've killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧   她会爱上这艘船的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding? She'll love this boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  尊夫人芳名  她叫潘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y-Yeah! What is your wife's name? It's Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,潘  天哪  想像一下叫  "潘号"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pam. Oh God okay, Just imagine this. The Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想她不会喜欢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think she'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那想像一下叫  "波芒先生号"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Uh, imagine this: The Mr. Bowmont.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是不要了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我给你描绘一下  行吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look. Let me paint you a little picture. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.01,0:16:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你正在哈德逊河上航行  风吹过你的（头） 胳膊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are setting sail up the Hudson. You've got the wind in your ha-Arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在享受着企盼已久的平静和安宁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get all that peace and quiet that you've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你回到大自然的怀抱   你可以钓鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get back to nature. You can go fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还可以戴顶帽子   别人会叫你船长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get one of those hats, and people call you captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你老了就是  老船长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then when you're old, Cappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管他的  不买说不过去  我买了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell. It's for a good cause. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别想  船是我的  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way! It's mine! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说的那些  也是我想要的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The stuff you said, I want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是乔伊  你没有两万元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, Joey, you don't have $20,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:17:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管他的  我分期  无论如何我都要 "波芒先生号"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who cares? I'll make payments! whatever it takes, I want the Mr. Bowmont!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  你回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看  让我看你的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要看我的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you want to see my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看你手上拿的什么  我想看垃圾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to see what's in your hand, I wanna see the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好脏啊  你最好拿去扔了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ew, it's all dirty. You should throw this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们搞什么啊  怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you  guys just do? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查也在  我无法开口  不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard was there. I couldn't do it. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要拖延到明天  给她个惊喜  却被你们破坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was gonna do it tomorrow y'know,and surprise her. but now you've ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有破坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We didn't ruin it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会一进门就要看别人的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who walks into a room and asks to see a person's hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算命师  修指甲的小姐  手部医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, a palm reader, a manicurist, a hand doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手套推销员  漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Glove salesman. Good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真惨  我该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is terrible. What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她只是在怀疑  又不确定  你可以唬她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, she only suspects something okay? She doesn’t know for sure, so just throw her off the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对  我可以让她觉得  我完全不考虑结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That’s right, I'll make her think, uh, marriage is the last thing on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  让她相信你很害怕承诺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Convince her you're scared of commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我做得到  我都练了30年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can do that. I've had 30 years of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个人总算有点价值了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, being you is finally gonna pay off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.79,0:18:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还得跑去地下室扔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to go to the basement...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某个白痴小孩老是用披萨盒  把垃圾槽堵住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...some idiot keeps stuffing the chute with pizza boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙还是没改\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That guy's still doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  你们回来了  我看看你的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. My God, you're here, let me see your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  来不及了   她已经把垃圾拿去扔了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you're too late! She already took out the trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟别人分手还没这么平和过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. I have never had such a healthy breakup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她表现得好成熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was such a grownup about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不幼雅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She didn't seem too immature for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道我犯了个大错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did I just make a huge mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.33,0:19:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白  太好了   我在想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Elizabeth, thank God. I was just thinking about--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分手还是有效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Breakup's still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.11,0:19:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样   我像不像个不想结婚的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do I look? Do I look like a guy who doesn't want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  还有点像法国人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, also, a little like a French guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还第一次发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never noticed that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞎混时间   讨论讨论   互联网\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just hanging out. Talking about, uh, web sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.17,0:19:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个讨论婚姻的网站还挺有趣的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. We saw this really interesting website about marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说婚姻是多么无用啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and how totally unnecessary it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说那只不过是政府监视你的方式\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and how it's just a way for governments to keep tabs on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊   老大哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Big Brother. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是有点夸张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我很高兴  你们能在网上了解更多的内容\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although I am y'know glad to hear that you're branching out on what you look at on the Internet.Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就想   为什么会有人想要结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, it just got me thinking though, why would anybody want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  因为要赞颂彼此的感情  巩固彼此的承诺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? To celebrate the relationship. To solidify the commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要向全世界宣布你们彼此的爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To declare your love for one another to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴知道这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Well, that's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"波芒先生号" 来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The Mr. Bowmont's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  有位客人想向主厨你致意  让他进来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Monica, there's a customer wants to compliment the chef, Shall I let him in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我最爱这种了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure! I love this part!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.81,0:20:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on in. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我不是来向主厨致意的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I'm not here to compliment the chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我最讨厌客人跑来致意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. that's okay I hate when people come back to compliment the chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像我很闲似的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like I've nothing better to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天晚上遇见你很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it was great seeing you the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是来说这个的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you come down here to tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我是来说其它事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Came here to tell you something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来想告诉你  我仍然爱着你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Came here to tell you I still love you.
